{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/s1_sub_006.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/s1_sub_006.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_01",
      "hash64": "4A63BD332C8423A6",
      "text": "哦哦～呵、呵、呵！\\n哦哦～呵、呵、呵！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_02",
      "hash64": "4A63BC332C8421F3",
      "text": "毅万，看呀！\\n多棒的盆栽啊！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_01",
      "hash64": "2F7DE3952507E0F8",
      "text": "馥好！\\n这是果园哦！\\r\\n虽然在你来看它可能只是个盆栽！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_03",
      "hash64": "4A63BB332C842040",
      "text": "不会吧……？\\n这是果树的园子！？\\r\\n多么地朴素啊！！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_04",
      "hash64": "4A63C2332C842C25",
      "text": "毅万！\\n谢谢你的订正哦。[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_02",
      "hash64": "2F7DE6952507E611",
      "text": "不用谢！毕竟庶民的生态\\n还有很多谜团呢！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_05",
      "hash64": "4A63C1332C842A72",
      "text": "啊啊～庶民！\\n多么不可思议的存在……\\r\\n无论何时都能让我心潮澎湃！！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_06",
      "hash64": "4A63C0332C8428BF",
      "text": "哎呀……？说到就到，\\n我们熟悉的那位庶民！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_03",
      "hash64": "2F7DE5952507E45E",
      "text": "还真是。毫无疑问，\\n那就是我们熟悉的庶民！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_07",
      "hash64": "4A63BF332C84270C",
      "text": "我想要进一步了解庶民！\\n想要拉近和庶民的距离！！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_08",
      "hash64": "4A63C6332C8432F1",
      "text": "……因此，你可以\\n再次和我决斗吗？[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_04",
      "hash64": "2F7DE8952507E977",
      "text": "出……出现了！\\n馥好的爱好！\\r\\n通过对战来了解对方的那一套～！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_09",
      "hash64": "4A63C5332C84313E",
      "text": "呵呵呵……要是做好心理准备了，\\n就由庶民你来邀请我开始吧。[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_npc",
      "hash64": "C7A9B36FA70B1822",
      "text": "能和名流决斗可是千金难买的机会！\\n快去和馥好搭话呀！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_10",
      "hash64": "4A60B8332C81E550",
      "text": "来和我决斗！\\n你愿意接受吧？[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_11",
      "hash64": "4A60B9332C81E703",
      "text": "……虽说偶尔被庶民\\n吊吊胃口也不错……\\c\\n但名流的时间是宝贵的！\\n现在立刻就来开打咯～～～！！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_12",
      "hash64": "4A60BA332C81E8B6",
      "text": "帕底亚不动产的社长馥好！\\n要来碾压庶民咯～～～！！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_05",
      "hash64": "2F7DE7952507E7C4",
      "text": "咻～咻～！\\n加油呀，馥好！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_13",
      "hash64": "4A60BB332C81EA69",
      "text": "我又一次输了！\\n你究竟是何方神圣呀！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_14",
      "hash64": "4A60BC332C81EC1C",
      "text": "我说，毅万！\\n庶民都很擅长宝可梦对战吗！？\\r\\n还是说只是这一位很特别！？[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_06",
      "hash64": "2F7DEA952507ECDD",
      "text": "馥好，这个庶民一定是拥有\\n被选中的庶民才有的……[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_07",
      "hash64": "2F7DE9952507EB2A",
      "text": "名为进取心的特质呀！！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_15",
      "hash64": "4A60BD332C81EDCF",
      "text": "进取心！？就是名流一辈子\\n都不会拥有的那个特质……！？[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_16",
      "hash64": "4A60BE332C81EF82",
      "text": "难怪我赢不了呀。现在遮住眼睛的\\n丸子珍珠一掉，我突然就看清了……[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_17",
      "hash64": "4A60BF332C81F135",
      "text": "……说到珍珠，\\n我就想去水边了呢！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_18",
      "hash64": "4A60C0332C81F2E8",
      "text": "好了，毅万！\\n我现在想立刻到帕底亚\\r\\n看看最[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]广大的水边[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_08",
      "hash64": "2F7DDC952507D513",
      "text": "咻～！好奇心\\n总是来得这么突然！\\r\\n馥好你真是名流的典范呀！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_09",
      "hash64": "2F7DDB952507D360",
      "text": "我们去湖边的小岛\\n缓解决斗后的疲劳吧！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_secretary_01",
      "hash64": "4A3450DFFC4B52BA",
      "text": "馥好小姐和毅万先生\\n在北上乡本地\\r\\n前去观赏水果园了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
